<section class="page-hero"><div class="shell page-hero-content"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="hairline"></span>01 / PRIVACY / CONFIDENTIALIT&Eacute;</div><h1>Privacy &amp; website information</h1><p>A transparent explanation of how this demonstration website handles information.</p></div></section><section class="section shell privacy-copy"><article><span>01</span><h2>Information collected</h2><p>This static website does not operate a database or collect contact form submissions on a server. When you use the contact form, your own email application is opened with a draft message.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>Some example editorial photographs are sourced from Unsplash. Loading these resources may communicate technical information such as your IP address to that provider. Local visual alternatives are packaged with the website.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h2>Contact and data rights</h2><p>For requests relating to data provided by email, contact the Group using its published email address. The operating company must review the final privacy policy against local law prior to publication.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h2>Accuracy</h2><p>All descriptions are editorial and should be checked by the company before deployment. Illustrative images do not prove asset ownership, industrial capacity or a completed client project.</p></article></section>
</SiteLayout>
